# Listing output ports (Phase 3, fake device): every output subdevice
# of every card, as the port name seq_open() takes, with the card,
# device and subdevice names. A device with input only is left out,
# and opening it for output fails as no such port; so is a card that
# can't be opened (no permission). Nothing is left open.
ports
fakedev port 1 0 2
fakedev port 1 2 1
fakedev port 3 0 1
fakedev port 3 1 1
fakedev inonly 3 1
fakedev port 5 0 1
fakedev deny 5
ports
open device hw:3,1,0
devdiag
fakedev log
